This chapter shares only illustrategeodude and illustrateonix.

Use the page library.
Use the foundation chapter.

To illustrategeodude at an x (number) by a y (number):
  Let the top be the y + 16.
  Let the raised forearm be a list of 1, 10, 2, 7, 5, 5, 9, 4, 12, 5, 15, 3, 17, 3, 18, 5, 16, 7, 13, 8, 11, 10, 10, 12, 7, 13, 8, 16, 10, 18, 13, 18, 14, 22, 10, 22, 7, 20, 5, 18, 3, 15.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the raised forearm as 3.
  Let the raised wrist be a list of 4, 13, 7, 14, 8, 17, 10, 19, 12, 19, 11, 21, 8, 19, 5, 17.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the raised wrist as 1.
  Let the high knuckles be a list of 2, 9, 4, 7, 9, 5, 11, 6, 14, 5, 16, 4, 17, 5, 14, 7, 12, 8, 10, 9, 7, 10, 4, 12, 3, 12.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the high knuckles as 2.
  Let the finger light be a list of 3, 8, 6, 6, 10, 5, 11, 7, 8, 7, 7, 9, 6, 7, 5, 9, 3, 10.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the finger light as 1.
  Let the folded fingers be a list of 3, 11, 6, 9, 9, 8, 10, 10, 8, 11, 6, 11, 4, 13.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the folded fingers as 3.
  Let the lower arm be a list of 29, 22, 32, 22, 34, 24, 37, 26, 39, 28, 39, 31, 37, 34, 36, 35, 31, 35, 29, 32, 29, 29, 27, 28.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the lower arm as 3.
  Let the shoulder shadow be a list of 29, 24, 32, 24, 35, 26, 38, 28, 38, 31, 36, 32, 33, 29, 30, 28.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the shoulder shadow as 2.
  Let the knuckles be a list of 30, 29, 32, 29, 35, 31, 36, 32, 38, 30, 37, 32, 35, 34, 33, 34, 32, 32, 31, 33.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the knuckles as 1.
  Let the rock silhouette be a list of 10, 18, 11, 15, 11, 13, 14, 11, 18, 10, 24, 10, 28, 11, 30, 13, 32, 16, 33, 20, 33, 24, 30, 26, 28, 29, 24, 31, 18, 31, 15, 29, 13, 27, 11, 24.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the rock silhouette as 3.
  Let the face plane be a list of 11, 18, 13, 15, 13, 13, 17, 12, 19, 11, 24, 11, 28, 12, 31, 15, 31, 18, 32, 21, 31, 24, 28, 27, 25, 29, 21, 30, 17, 29, 14, 26, 12, 24.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the face plane as 1.
  Let the crown ridge be a list of 12, 16, 14, 13, 17, 12, 17, 15, 15, 17, 13, 17.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the crown ridge as 2.
  Let the crown glint be a list of 12, 14, 15, 12, 16, 12, 15, 15, 14, 16.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the crown glint as 0.
  Let the center facet be a list of 17, 12, 19, 11, 23, 11, 24, 12, 22, 14, 20, 15, 18, 14.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the center facet as 0.
  Let the side facet be a list of 24, 13, 28, 12, 30, 14, 32, 17, 31, 20, 30, 16, 28, 14, 25, 15.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the side facet as 2.
  Let the chin shadow be a list of 14, 25, 17, 27, 20, 29, 26, 27, 29, 25, 28, 28, 24, 30, 18, 30.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the chin shadow as 2.
  Let the far brow be a list of 11, 17, 13, 17, 16, 18, 16, 20, 14, 19, 12, 18.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the far brow as 3.
  Let the near brow be a list of 19, 20, 22, 17, 25, 17, 26, 18, 23, 18, 21, 20.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the near brow as 3.
  Let the far eye be a list of 13, 21, 15, 22, 16, 25, 15, 25, 13, 23.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the far eye as 0.
  Let the near eye be a list of 20, 24, 23, 21, 25, 21, 23, 24, 20, 26.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the near eye as 0.
  Let the far pupil be a list of 14, 21, 15, 21, 16, 23, 15, 23.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the far pupil as 3.
  Let the near pupil be a list of 21, 22, 23, 21, 22, 23, 21, 24.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the near pupil as 3.
  Let the mouth be a list of 16, 28, 18, 27, 20, 28, 24, 26, 23, 28, 20, 29.
  Shade Screen at the x by the top with the mouth as 3.

To outcrop at a left (number) by a top (number) with a breadth (number) over a height (number):
  Let the middle be (the breadth / 2) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  Let the ledge be (the height / 2) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  Let the edge be a list of 0, the ledge, 2, 2, the middle, 0, (the breadth - 2), 1, the breadth, the ledge, (the breadth - 2), (the height - 1), the middle, the height, 1, (the height - 2).
  Shade Screen at the left by the top with the edge as 3.
  Let the dark face be a list of 1, the ledge, 3, 2, the middle, 1, (the middle + 1), the ledge, the middle, (the height - 2), 2, (the height - 3).
  Shade Screen at the left by the top with the dark face as 2.
  Let the light face be a list of the middle, (the ledge - 1), (the breadth - 2), 3, (the breadth - 1), the ledge, (the breadth - 2), (the height - 3), (the middle + 1), (the height - 2).
  Shade Screen at the left by the top with the light face as 1.
  Trace Screen from (the left + the middle + 1) by (the top + the ledge) to (the left + the breadth - 3) at (the top + the ledge - 1) with 0.

To illustrateonix at an x (number) by a y (number):
  Outcrop at (the x + 5) by (the y + 20) with 5 over 8.
  Outcrop at (the x + 3) by (the y + 25) with 7 over 9.
  Outcrop at (the x + 3) by (the y + 31) with 9 over 10.
  Outcrop at (the x + 5) by (the y + 38) with 10 over 11.
  Outcrop at (the x + 12) by (the y + 43) with 11 over 11.
  Outcrop at (the x + 21) by (the y + 43) with 14 over 12.
  Outcrop at (the x + 30) by (the y + 37) with 15 over 12.
  Outcrop at (the x + 36) by (the y + 27) with 15 over 14.
  Outcrop at (the x + 37) by (the y + 15) with 15 over 16.
  Outcrop at (the x + 28) by (the y + 6) with 17 over 20.
  Let the skull be a list of 11, 11, 14, 8, 14, 2, 15, 0, 17, 3, 18, 8, 21, 7, 25, 8, 28, 9, 30, 11, 32, 15, 31, 20, 30, 22, 28, 25, 26, 27, 25, 30, 22, 32, 18, 31, 15, 29, 13, 28, 13, 23, 14, 22, 12, 21, 11, 18, 12, 16.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the skull as 3.
  Let the crown be a list of 12, 12, 16, 9, 19, 10, 20, 8, 24, 9, 27, 10, 29, 12, 30, 15, 29, 18, 26, 20, 23, 19, 22, 16, 18, 18, 15, 17, 12, 15.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the crown as 1.
  Let the horn be a list of 14, 2, 16, 1, 17, 7, 18, 13, 18, 16, 16, 15, 15, 10.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the horn as 2.
  Let the horn glint be a list of 14, 3, 15, 2, 16, 6, 16, 10, 17, 13, 16, 12.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the horn glint as 0.
  Let the brow ridge be a list of 12, 16, 17, 17, 19, 16, 22, 15, 25, 13, 26, 12, 25, 16, 22, 18, 18, 20, 16, 21, 15, 19.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the brow ridge as 2.
  Let the near eye be a list of 18, 21, 20, 18, 26, 16, 25, 20, 23, 22, 19, 23.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the near eye as 3.
  Let the near sclera be a list of 20, 21, 22, 19, 25, 18, 24, 20, 22, 21.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the near sclera as 0.
  Let the eye slit be a list of 22, 19, 23, 18, 23, 20, 22, 20.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the eye slit as 3.
  Let the far eye be a list of 13, 18, 15, 20, 14, 21, 13, 20.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the far eye as 0.
  Let the snout be a list of 14, 23, 16, 21, 17, 19, 18, 21, 18, 25, 21, 25, 26, 23, 29, 20, 28, 23, 25, 26, 21, 29, 17, 29, 14, 27.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the snout as 1.
  Let the cheek be a list of 19, 23, 23, 23, 26, 21, 29, 19, 28, 22, 25, 24, 21, 26, 18, 27.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the cheek as 2.
  Let the lower lip be a list of 16, 28, 20, 29, 25, 27, 23, 30, 21, 31, 18, 30.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the lower lip as 2.
  Let the jaw glint be a list of 21, 30, 24, 28, 23, 30, 22, 31.
  Shade Screen at the x by the y with the jaw glint as 0.
